    name: "Winter Witch",
    summary: "Ten-level frost caster, half BAB, full casting, 4 HP a level: higher cold DCs and caster level, hex progression, half its cold damage past immunity.",
    guide: "prestige-classes#winter-witch",
    skill_points: 2,
